# Release check for tiny-php-lib

Dependencies are installed with `composer install` and the tests run with `./vendor/bin/phpunit`.
See the [testing guide](https://phpunit.de/) and the [contributing notes](https://github.com/steplet-corpus/tiny-php-lib/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).

Report the summary line exactly as printed.
